/public/ocr/

# Internal dev record — local working files, NEVER committed (kept out of the
# public repo; history was rewritten 2026-07-16 to remove them).
CLAUDE.md
docs/PUNCHLIST.md
docs/architecture/
docs/reviews/
# Hygiene-pass additions (2026-07-24): the doc map, archived punchlist
# history, and external-baseline reference material (names competitors —
# must never reach the public repo).
docs/README.md
docs/archive/
docs/reference/
*.local.*
# ...and scratch DIRECTORIES, which the pattern above misses: it needs a dot
# after "local", so `u1-shots.local/` was landing in git status as untracked.
*.local/
# Owner's scratch input file (instructions dropped in for a session).
userinput.md

# LibreOffice runtime for O1 export (assembled by scripts/bundle-libreoffice.ps1;
# large, gitignored like resources/python & resources/ghostscript).
resources/libreoffice/
tests/softhsm2/
